ics we needed to capture."}]]}],["$","article","04",{"className":"mvp-card","tabIndex":0,"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mvp-number","children":["MVP ","04"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Design for Reasoning"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-keywords","children":"Short answer · Student testing · Dashboard v2"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-detail","children":"Expanded beyond multiple choice. I designed the short-answer flow, feedback and support features, tested them with students, and iterated the teacher dashboard using classroom insights."}]]}],["$","article","05",{"className":"mvp-card","tabIndex":0,"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mvp-number","children":["MVP ","05"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Polish & Integrate"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-keywords","children":"Final system · AI-assisted design-to-dev"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mvp-detail","children":"Brought the full system together. I refined the student and teacher experiences, supported implementation, and used AI-assisted tools to accelerate exploration and polish."}]]}]]}]]}]
e:["$","section",null,{"className":"case-section decisions-section","aria-labelledby":"decisions-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"case-section-intro","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"case-section-label","children":"Key design decisions"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"decisions-heading","children":["The work behind",["$","br",null,{}],["$","em",null,{"children":"the visible interface."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"decision-list","children":[["$","article","01",{"className":"decision-block","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"decision-copy","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"decision-number","children":["Decision ","01"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Design the level of support, not just the interface"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"decision-tags","children":"Product Thinking · Iteration · Tradeoffs"}],["$","dl",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Context"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"For MVP 1, I designed four practice modes—Guided, Practice, Exam, and Review—with different levels of scaffolding for different learning stages."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Problem"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Testing showed students keyword-matching answer choices instead of reasoning. Guided Mode felt too easy, while Practice Mode felt long and repetitive."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"decision-emphasis","children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Decision"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"I merged Guided and Practice into one experience with on-demand hints and conditional support, so help appeared when needed without forcing every student through the same scaffolding."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"decision-media decision-media-image","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Product screen"}],false,["$","figure",null,{"className":"decision-media-frame","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/projects/kb-tutor/decision-1-modes.png","alt":"KB Tutor screen for choo